294
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,360
Otherwise, it'd take up too much brain
space.

295
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:11,920
Go ahead.

296
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,720
You can memorize other people's lines too?

297
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:31,280
Yes.

298
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,000
For instance,

299
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,840
your eyes,

300
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,520
your smile,

301
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,560
bright as the stars,

302
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,360
gentle as the night breeze,

303
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:44,320
are the most beautiful sights I've ever
seen.

304
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:48,960
Yanzi,

305
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:51,920
sorry to interrupt.

306
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:58,960
The fans have half an hour to visit the
set.

307
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,240
When you're ready,

308
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,560
please head over.

309
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,160
I'm so worried.

310
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,040
Our Yiliang is so accommodating.

311
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:12,880
What if some clingy fame-leech

312
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,679
latches onto him?

313
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,080
Exactly.

314
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,400
I'm so concerned.

315
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,320
Our Yanzi is so innocent.

316
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,519
I hope he doesn't get fooled

317
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:22,519
by some two-faced fake saint.

318
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,400
Exactly.

319
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,160
What do you mean?

320
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:24,840
Who do you mean?

321
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:25,640
You.

322
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:26,120
Who?

323
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:26,960
Two-faced fake saint!

324
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:27,480
What did you say?

325
00:15:27,481 --> 00:15:29,200
What? I'm talking about you!

326
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,360
Am I wrong?

327
00:15:30,361 --> 00:15:32,039
The actors are here!

328
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,719
- Yanzi!
- Yiliang!

329
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,440
Long time no see.

330
00:15:34,441 --> 00:15:36,839
Hello, everyone! It's been a while.

331
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:37,999
One bag has snacks, the other autographs.

332
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:38,960
Hand them out, please.

333
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:39,280
Sure.

334
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:40,120
Are you tired?

335
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:42,240
No. It must be hot out here.

336
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:45,200
Yanzi, this is a gift from your Meiyan
fans.

337
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,256
How much did you spend this time?

338
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,496
My assistant will reimburse you.

339
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,160
No need.

340
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:51,400
Only fans with jobs contributed this time.

341
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,840
We didn't take money from students.

342
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:53,680
All right.

343
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:54,640
Thank you, everyone.

344
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:55,880
No more gifts next time.

345
00:15:55,881 --> 00:15:57,321
Yiliang, can you do the little ears?

346
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,480
Yanzi,

347
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,720
your rival and his people

348
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,720
haven't been making things hard for you?

349
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:05,400
My rival?

350
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,520
See for yourselves.

351
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,960
Gu Yiliang,

352
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,080
smile.

353
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,359
They want a photo of us together.

354
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,520
Let's take one back there.

355
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,320
Sure.

356
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:20,920
Let's go.

357
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:21,320
Come on.

358
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:22,760
Thanks.

359
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,680
Take pictures!

360
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:29,880
- Yanzi!
- Yiliang!

361
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:44,679
Come on! Bring on the flashes!

362
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,999
Niangzi fans,

363
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:52,320
this stumbling block wants to help build
your ship!

364
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,400
Are you free tonight?

365
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,640
If you are,

366
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,840
want to rehearse with me?

367
00:16:57,160 --> 00:16:58,360
Am I up to it?

368
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,280
I memorize lines, but deliver them without
feeling.

369
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,520
About today's "I'll keep you safe" scene,

370
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:05,360
I'm sorry.

371
00:17:06,600 --> 00:17:07,600
It's fine.

372
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:09,360
We got the last take, didn't we?

373
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:11,080
We didn't fall behind schedule.

374
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,400
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

375
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,760
Yanzi!

376
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:19,720
Would you like an autograph?

377
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:21,360
Yes.

378
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,200
Here.

379
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,280
Thank you, Yanzi.

380
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,320
You're welcome.

381
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,760
Bring someone along next time.

382
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:30,120
Um,

383
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,960
could you personalize it?

384
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:33,560
Sure. Who should I make it out to?

385
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,880
To.

386
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,440
WilliamLianWei.

387
00:17:41,953 --> 00:17:46,199
These people on the slide are
our Niangzi ship's finest creators.

388
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,639
The backbone of Niangzi fanfiction!

389
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,199
The great WilliamLianWei!

390
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,920
So it's you!

391
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,400
It's okay.

392
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:56,240
You don't have to if you don't want to.

393
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,240
I want to! Really!

394
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,120
Mr. Gu Yiliang!

395
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,160
Huh?

396
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:05,440
Can I sign this?

397
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:06,680
Of course.

398
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,040
Want me to sign it too?

399
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:08,560
Yes.

400
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,280
Sure.

401
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,400
Here.

402
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,919
Girl, stop squealing!

403
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:18,160
Tonight's new smut
will send me into orbit.

404
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:32,200
Oh!

405
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,400
No, no.

406
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:35,800
Don't let my name

407
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:37,800
ruin this beautiful moment.

408
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:39,400
I'm not worthy.

409
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:44,480
I'll leave you two alone, then.

410
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:46,040
Get home safely.

411
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:46,760
Okay.

412
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:47,720
Thanks for coming.

413
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,240
Bye.

414
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:49,320
Bye!

415
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,279
Great WilliamLianWei,

416
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:52,719
I'm waiting for your new fic!

417
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,720
Write faster!

418
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:57,320
We're like parents sending our kid to
college.

419
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:02,721
I get it. I'm the stumbling block.

420
00:19:02,746 --> 00:19:05,413
He's the real Niangzi master.

421
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:06,960
Let's go.

422
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:09,360
Let me carry that.

423
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:12,280
Oh, green.

424
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,760
It suits me.

425
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,480
Jing, I'm here.

426
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:25,320
I brought you a Mixue lemonade.

427
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,640
Thank you, Lucas.

428
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:27,080
Sit down.

429
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:27,560
Okay.

430
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,680
I'll get started.

431
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:33,160
I've always thought you suited this role
best.

432
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:36,120
Your costume photos looked great too.

433
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:38,999
Sorry. I want this seat.

434
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Find somewhere else.

435
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:42,240
Mr. Chi,

436
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:44,880
could you wait over there a moment?

437
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,240
Why do his makeup first?

438
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,280
I'm due on set!

439
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Well...

440
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,680
It's okay, Jing.

441
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,160
I'll wait.

442
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,720
All right.

443
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,640
Have a seat, Mr. Chi.

444
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:01,680
Let me tell you,

445
00:20:01,681 --> 00:20:02,720
there are some people

446
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:04,640
you shouldn't get too close to.

447
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:06,160
The director said

448
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,040
the role of Chu Feng

449
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,400
was mine.

450
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:09,600
But would you believe it?

451
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:11,520
Who knows what dirty tricks he pulled

452
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,920
or whose strings he pulled?

453
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,240
Oh, I know.

454
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,440
He found some bald old man

455
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:18,080
to let him in the back door.

456
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:20,120
Hilarious.

457
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:21,960
Hey, what are you doing?

458
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:23,040
That hurts!

459
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:24,800
What?

460
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Got a problem with me?

461
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:27,456
You're just a damn makeup artist.

462
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:29,040
Who are you to comment on casting?

463
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,920
Do you know who's backing me?

464
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,120
Do you want to lose your job?

465
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:33,960
Hurry up.

466
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:35,320
You're so slow.

467
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:38,360
- Keep talking!
- Hey!

468
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,416
- Ride a sewage truck? Your mouth stinks!
- Are you crazy?

469
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:42,040
- Keep talking!
- What's wrong with you?

470
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:44,160
You're the one who stole my role?

471
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:44,680
You psycho!

472
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:45,040
Say it!

473
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:46,040
Bastard!

474
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:46,720
No fighting, please!

475
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,040
Please stop fighting!

476
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,480
Please, stop!

477
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:02,280
I'm sorry

478
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:03,640
I kept you waiting so late.

479
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:04,520
It's fine.

480
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:06,176
We agreed to rehearse back at the hotel.

481
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,200
Let's go.

482
00:21:08,120 --> 00:21:10,240
I wanted to buy you a late-night meal,

483
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:12,240
but at this hour,

484
00:21:12,600 --> 00:21:14,120
all the nearby restaurants are closed.

485
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:15,800
No delivery options either.

486
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,080
Come with me.

487
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:18,280
I'll treat you to a feast.

488
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:19,360
A feast?

489
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,000
Done for the day.

490
00:21:23,360 --> 00:21:24,360
What?

491
00:21:25,373 --> 00:21:26,093
Ma'am,

492
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:27,640
I'll treat you to a feast too.

493
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:29,520
I'm not going.

494
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,640
Suit yourself.

495
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,200
Okay.

496
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:54,760
Let's go.

497
00:22:10,840 --> 00:22:12,680
Sorry to keep you waiting, Mr. Gu.

498
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:13,920
Here.

499
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:16,960
One moment.

500
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:23,280
Done!

501
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:25,600
Mr. Gu,

502
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,816
this is an unmanned convenience store.

503
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:27,520
Nobody's here at night.

504
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:28,920
No one's going to photograph us.

505
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:30,840
Here.

506
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:33,600
Convenience-store ochazuke.

507
00:22:33,840 --> 00:22:35,320
I picked fish balls for the oden.

508
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:37,240
Crab sticks instead of shrimp paste.

509
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:39,080
And a soy-braised beef rice ball.

510
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,080
Trust me.

511
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:45,040
It may look bad, but it'll taste great.

512
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:46,880
It's just...

513
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,520
I feel like this

514
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,360
is exactly my kind of food.

515
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:51,600
Really?

516
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,199
All those quizzes I took to unlock fanfics

517
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:56,240
about Gu Yiliang paid off!

518
00:22:57,360 --> 00:22:58,360
Dig in.

519
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,240
It really is good.

520
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:03,320
Right?

521
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:10,080
How do you know these secret recipes?

522
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,656
I used to work at a convenience store.

523
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:14,120
They discounted food close to its expiry
date.

524
00:23:14,280 --> 00:23:16,440
So I looked up convenience-store recipes.

525
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,520
You worked there?

526
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,360
I thought you debuted while at university.

527
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:27,240
How did you know that?

528
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:32,160
Xiao Zhang looked up an interview with
you.

529
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,120
Oh.

530
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:34,320
It was just

531
00:23:34,400 --> 00:23:36,440
some college photos that went viral.

532
00:23:36,520 --> 00:23:38,000
That's when an agency contacted me.

533
00:23:38,280 --> 00:23:39,720
What about you, Mr. Gu?

534
00:23:40,120 --> 00:23:41,760
How did you get into acting?

535
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:43,400
My debut?

536
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:43,960
Hey,

537
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:45,200
let me guess.

538
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:46,880
I think you

539
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:48,160
must really love it.

540
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,479
Otherwise,

541
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:50,840
you couldn't act so well.

542
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:52,920
If anyone tells me

543
00:23:53,120 --> 00:23:55,040
nothing in this world is perfect,

544
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:57,960
I'll show them Gu Yiliang when he's acting.

545
00:24:00,120 --> 00:24:01,240
Only when I'm acting?

546
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:02,840
No!

547
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:03,720
Mr. Gu,

548
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:05,360
I mean,

549
00:24:05,840 --> 00:24:06,640
I... I think...

550
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:07,720
I'm kidding.

551
00:24:10,080 --> 00:24:11,400
Getting into acting

552
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,480
was kind of an accident.

553
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:16,080
But when I'm acting,

554
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:17,320
it really does feel good.

555
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,520
Like I've come alive in color.

556
00:24:22,080 --> 00:24:23,840
Who knows how many years I have left,
though?

557
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:26,560
Actors these days

558
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:28,200
are almost being replaced by AI.

559
00:24:29,840 --> 00:24:31,040
Not you, Mr. Gu.

560
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:33,280
AI will only replace cream puffs like me.

561
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:35,360
A talented actor like you will keep going.

562
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:37,040
You'll act into old age.

563
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,640
Mr. Gu,

564
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:50,920
let's act till we're old.

565
00:24:51,320 --> 00:24:52,320
Huh?

566
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:57,760
Mr. Gu,

567
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:58,760
I'll teach you the CEO act.

568
00:24:58,960 --> 00:24:59,960
Come on.

569
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:02,440
First,

570
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:03,760
cross your arms.

571
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:06,040
Look down.

572
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:09,320
Look up with a wicked smirk.

573
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,000
And here's another one.

574
00:25:13,040 --> 00:25:14,040
An idol skill.

575
00:25:15,360 --> 00:25:16,360
Little cat ears.

576
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,640
Sorry, Mr. Gu.

577
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,760
Cat ears.

578
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:25,360
Puppy ears.

579
00:25:25,600 --> 00:25:26,840
Here's something even more fun.

580
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:32,480
Open your mouth.

581
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:33,680
Open up.

582
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:35,400
Ah.

583
00:25:40,080 --> 00:25:41,640
No, I want a turn too.

584
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:42,480
Open your mouth.

585
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,480
My turn, then.

586
00:25:43,840 --> 00:25:44,840
Ah.

587
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:45,920
Ah.

588
00:25:46,320 --> 00:25:47,320
Ah.

589
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:51,760
Didn't you say this store was unmanned?

590
00:25:52,520 --> 00:25:54,640
High schoolers out this late?

591
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,880
Must be a secret romance.

592
00:25:56,120 --> 00:25:57,120
Let's go.

593
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,280
The usual place.

594
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:28,560
Hey! Delivery riders can't enter the
complex.

595
00:26:30,120 --> 00:26:31,800
You young people work yourselves to death.

596
00:26:31,840 --> 00:26:33,520
Taking orders when you're this badly hurt?

597
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,680
Sir,

598
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:36,080
I'm not a delivery rider.

599
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:38,280
I just bought this bike secondhand.

600
00:26:39,120 --> 00:26:40,400
Then what do you do?

601
00:26:41,520 --> 00:26:42,520
Yeah.

602
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:44,040
What do I even do?

603
00:26:44,520 --> 00:26:46,280
A workhorse by day,

604
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:48,520
A whore by night.

605
00:26:50,709 --> 00:26:52,229
Happy City Convenience Store

606
00:26:55,110 --> 00:26:56,556
[Brook Street]

607
00:26:59,709 --> 00:27:01,983
[Wang Huanxu: Send me 30,000,000]

608
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:26,760
Mr. Gu.

609
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:29,800
Sorry.

610
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:30,960
I suddenly wanted a smoke.

611
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:34,360
Aren't you afraid I'll expose
you with an alt account?

612
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:36,800
You go on ahead.

613
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:38,640
Don't wait for me.

614
00:27:38,760 --> 00:27:39,920
I'll head back when I'm done.

615
00:27:41,080 --> 00:27:42,080
Okay.

616
00:27:47,080 --> 00:27:49,120
Why did he suddenly get so down?

617
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:50,400
Mr. Gu,

618
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,400
I'm actually in no rush.

619
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:53,920
Why don't you teach me to smoke?

620
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:56,720
Why?

621
00:27:56,760 --> 00:27:57,200
Well,

622
00:27:57,360 --> 00:28:00,000
then you won't worry about
me exposing you online.

623
00:28:00,120 --> 00:28:01,680
We'll be partners in crime.

624
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:07,319
What? Sharing a cigarette?

625
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:08,320
I said partners in crime,

626
00:28:08,321 --> 00:28:09,359
not partners in romance.

627
00:28:09,360 --> 00:28:11,760
Buddy, remember you're straight?

628
00:28:37,223 --> 00:28:38,756
Bonus Content 2: Gu Yiliang's Diary 1

629
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:39,800
Douya,

630
00:28:40,120 --> 00:28:41,559
help me record a diary entry.

631
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:42,200
Certainly.

632
00:28:42,360 --> 00:28:45,120
I'll help record your feelings at this
moment.

633
00:28:45,360 --> 00:28:47,040
You may begin.

634
00:28:47,760 --> 00:28:49,400
My first week on the "Lan Jue" set

635
00:28:51,520 --> 00:28:53,120
has been unexpectedly nice.

636
00:28:54,560 --> 00:28:56,360
I wasn't planning to take this role,

637
00:28:57,280 --> 00:28:59,120
but the original lead got caught in a
scandal.

638
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:02,320
Director Lu is close to Mr. Cheng,

639
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:04,720
so they asked me to fill in.

640
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,560
They heard I took on a new project

641
00:29:11,160 --> 00:29:12,440
and came asking for money again.

642
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:16,840
Hmm.

643
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,480
My rival is in this production too.

644
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:21,320
When people heard we'd be working
together,

645
00:29:22,280 --> 00:29:24,000
my inbox nearly exploded.

646
00:29:24,600 --> 00:29:26,560
My fans all told me to watch out for him.

647
00:29:27,680 --> 00:29:30,200
As if my rival were eight feet tall,

648
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:34,200
ready to kill me with a giant serpent
spear.

649
00:29:35,080 --> 00:29:36,080
Or

650
00:29:36,600 --> 00:29:38,440
some wicked snake-headed demon.

651
00:29:39,760 --> 00:29:40,240
Understood.

652
00:29:40,440 --> 00:29:42,000
Based on your description,

653
00:29:42,200 --> 00:29:44,480
I've generated two concept images.

654
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:47,480
That's hideous.

655
00:29:52,320 --> 00:29:53,600
This is what he looks like.

656
00:29:54,840 --> 00:29:55,840
Cute, right?

657
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:57,080
Understood.

658
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,920
My analysis indicates

659
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:01,000
that your rival is not human.

660
00:30:02,560 --> 00:30:03,880
Your analysis is wrong.

661
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,920
He's a very good person.

662
00:30:06,600 --> 00:30:07,600
He's funny,

663
00:30:08,600 --> 00:30:09,800
and he bought me milk tea.

664
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:11,480
We added each other on WeChat.

665
00:30:12,280 --> 00:30:13,920
The way he did it

666
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,680
was rather cute.

667
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:24,800
Is it rude to call a man my age cute?

668
00:30:25,040 --> 00:30:26,880
Would that be impolite?

669
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:31,320
But he really is cute.

670
00:30:33,600 --> 00:30:35,760
Why did I just say "cute" three times?

671
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:39,480
I've counted for you.

672
00:30:39,600 --> 00:30:41,119
Including that and the earlier ones,

673
00:30:41,120 --> 00:30:43,520
you've said "cute" five times.

674
00:30:46,040 --> 00:30:47,320
Actually, I went to see him

675
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:49,080
because ever since filming started,

676
00:30:49,360 --> 00:30:50,880
things kept going wrong.

677
00:30:51,840 --> 00:30:53,400
Maybe we really are incompatible.

678
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,280
I felt a little rebellious.

679
00:30:55,800 --> 00:30:58,280
I wanted to see what would happen if I
approached him.

680
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,200
And then.

681
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:03,840
I found him watching

682
00:31:04,040 --> 00:31:05,880
a show I'd acted in ages ago.

683
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:07,720
He was completely absorbed.

684
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,720
Xiao Zhang said he was my fan.

685
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:15,960
He even knew I don't like sweets.

686
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:19,520
He gave me a stress toy and a towel too.

687
00:31:22,400 --> 00:31:26,600
So why had he never started a conversation
with me?

688
00:31:27,800 --> 00:31:29,879
Based on what you've told me,

689
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:32,400
perhaps he was shy.

690
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:35,560
That makes sense.

691
00:31:36,560 --> 00:31:37,560
After filming began,

692
00:31:38,840 --> 00:31:39,840
I rehearsed with him

693
00:31:40,040 --> 00:31:41,840
and tested it for myself.

694
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,440
I can guarantee

695
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:47,120
that if the way he acts around me

696
00:31:47,520 --> 00:31:49,160
is all an act,

697
00:31:50,760 --> 00:31:52,720
I'll quit acting for good.

698
00:31:54,520 --> 00:31:56,120
He really isn't calculating.

699
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:58,320
He doesn't keep his guard up at all.

700
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:01,920
Do you understand?

701
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:09,160
Um,

702
00:32:09,560 --> 00:32:11,000
when I said "cute,"

703
00:32:11,680 --> 00:32:13,400
it's because he's my fan.

704
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:17,280
I meant cute in the way fans are cute.

705
00:32:17,360 --> 00:32:18,439
Do you understand?

706
00:32:18,440 --> 00:32:20,039
I see.

707
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:22,960
A fan so cute, you said it five times.
